<title>UK: J.Rothschild new single premiums up in '96.</title>
<headline>J.Rothschild new single premiums up in '96.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> New single premiums    342.3		  vs 240.2</p>
<p> New regular premiums   52.4		   vs 37.4</p>
<p> Funds under management 1.7 bln		vs 1.3 bln</p>
<p> Total new business     86.6		   vs up 41 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - J.Rothschild Assurance Group is 51 percent owned by St. James's Place Capital Corp Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
